msgstr "Bibliotek för Reed-Solomon-kodning."

#. Summary
#: Package: golang-github-yiling-j-theine-go-dev
msgid "high performance in-memory cache (library)"
msgstr "minnesintern cache med hög prestanda (bibliotek)"

#. Description
#: Package: golang-github-yiling-j-theine-go-dev
msgid ""
"High performance in-memory & hybrid cache inspired by Caffeine "
"(https://github.com/ben-manes/caffeine)."
msgstr ""
"Minnesintern cache och hybridcache med hög prestanda, inspirerad av Caffeine"
" (https://github.com/ben-manes/caffeine)."

#. Description
#: Package: golang-github-yiling-j-theine-go-dev
msgid ""
"* Good performance * Support for Generics * High hit ratio with adaptive "
"W-TinyLFU (https://arxiv.org/pdf/1512. 00727.pdf) eviction policy * Expired "
"data are removed automatically using hierarchical timer wheel "
"(http://www.cs.columbia.edu/~nahum/w6998/papers/ton97-timing-wheels. pdf) * "
"Simple API"
msgstr ""
