"(http://www.cs.columbia.edu/~nahum/w6998/papers/ton97-timing-wheels. pdf) * "
"Enkelt API"

#. Summary
#: Package: golang-github-yosida95-uritemplate-dev
msgid "URI Template (RFC6570) implementation in Go (library)"
msgstr "URI Template-implementering (RFC6570) i Go (bibliotek)"

#. Description
#: Package: golang-github-yosida95-uritemplate-dev
msgid ""
"uritemplate is a Go implementation of URI Template (RFC6570) with full "
"functionality of URI Template Level 4."
msgstr ""
"uritemplate är en Go-implementation av URI Template (RFC6570) med full "
"funktionalitet för URI Template Level 4."

#. Description
#: Package: golang-github-yosida95-uritemplate-dev
msgid ""
"uritemplate can also generate a regexp that matches expansion of the URI "
"Template from a URI Template."
msgstr ""
"uritemplate kan även generera ett reguljärt uttryck som matchar utvidgningen"
