msgid "ASM API adapter for the JDK Class File API"
msgstr "ASM API-adapter för JDK Class File API"

#. Description
#: Package: libasm-jdk-bridge-java
msgid ""
"asm-jdk-bridge exposes the JDK Class File API (JEP-484 [1]) introduced in "
"Java 24 via the ASM API.  This is enables existing ASM-based application "
"code to leverage the new API without significant changes."
msgstr ""
"asm-jdk-bridge exponerar JDK Class File API (JEP-484 [1]), som "
"introducerades i Java 24, via ASM-API:t. Detta gör att befintlig ASM-baserad"
" programkod kan använda det nya API:t utan betydande ändringar."

