#. Summary
#: Package: libball1.5
msgid "Biochemical Algorithms Library"
msgstr "Biochemical Algorithms Library"

#. Description
#: Package: libball1.5
msgid ""
"This package contains the view - independent parts of BALL (libBALL, data "
"directories et al., except for libVIEW) and can be installed on machines "
"without X11."
msgstr ""
"Paketet innehåller de vyoberoende delarna av BALL (libBALL, datakataloger "
"med mera, utom libVIEW) och kan installeras på datorer utan X11."

#. Summary
#: Package: libball1.5-data
msgid "Biochemical Algorithms Library (data files)"
msgstr "Biochemical Algorithms Library (datafiler)"

#. Description
#: Package: libball1.5-data
msgid ""
"This package contains the data files (force field parameters, fragment data "
"bases, etc) necessary for using BALL."
msgstr ""
"Paketet innehåller de datafiler (kraftfältsparametrar, fragmentdatabaser med"
" mera) som behövs för att använda BALL."

#. Summary
#: Package: libball1.5-dev
msgid "Header files for the Biochemical Algorithms Library"
msgstr "Huvudfiler för Biochemical Algorithms Library"

#. Description
#: Package: libball1.5-dev
msgid ""
"This package comprises the header files allowing to create one's own "
"applications with the BALL library."
msgstr ""
"Paketet innehåller huvudfiler som gör det möjligt att skapa egna program med"
" biblioteket BALL."

#. Summary
#: Package: libball1.5-doc
msgid "documentation for the BALL library"
msgstr "dokumentation för biblioteket BALL"

#. Description
#: Package: libball1.5-doc
msgid ""
"BALL (Biochemical Algorithms Library) is an application framework in C++ "
"that has been specifically designed for rapid software development in "
"Molecular Modeling and Computational Molecular Biology. The package "
"comprises an extensive manual on how to program molecular modelling programs"
" with BALL."
msgstr ""
"BALL (Biochemical Algorithms Library) är ett programramverk i C++ som har "
"utformats särskilt för snabb programvaruutveckling inom molekylmodellering "
"och beräkningsbaserad molekylärbiologi. Paketet omfattar en utförlig handbok"
" om hur man programmerar molekylmodelleringsprogram med BALL."

#. Summary
#: Package: libballview1.5
msgid "Biochemical Algorithms Library, VIEW framework"
msgstr "Biochemical Algorithms Library, VIEW-ramverk"

#. Description
#: Package: libballview1.5 Package: libball1.5-dev Package: libball1.5-data
#: Package: libball1.5
msgid ""
"BALL (Biochemical Algorithms Library) is an application framework in C++ "
"that has been specifically designed for rapid software development in "
"Molecular Modeling and Computational Molecular Biology. It provides an "
"extensive set of data structures as well as classes for Molecular Mechanics,"
" advanced solvation methods, comparison and analysis of protein structures, "
"file import/export, and visualization. BALL is currently being developed in "
"the groups of Oliver Kohlbacher (University of Tuebingen, Germany), Andreas "
"Hildebrandt (Saarland University, Saarbruecken, Germany), and Hans-Peter "
"Lenhof (Saarland University, Saarbruecken, Germany)."
msgstr ""
"BALL (Biochemical Algorithms Library) är ett programramverk i C++ som har "
"utformats särskilt för snabb programvaruutveckling inom molekylmodellering "
"och beräkningsbaserad molekylärbiologi. Det tillhandahåller en omfattande "
"uppsättning datastrukturer samt klasser för molekylmekanik, avancerade "
"solvatiseringsmetoder, jämförelse och analys av proteinstrukturer, "
"filimport/-export och visualisering. BALL utvecklas för närvarande i "
"grupperna kring Oliver Kohlbacher (Tübingens universitet, Tyskland), Andreas"
" Hildebrandt (Saarlands universitet, Saarbrücken, Tyskland) och Hans-Peter "
"Lenhof (Saarlands universitet, Saarbrücken, Tyskland)."

#. Description
#: Package: libballview1.5
msgid ""
"This package contains the view parts of BALL (libVIEW). Those are required "
"for molecular visualization and for running BALLView."
msgstr ""
"Paketet innehåller vydelarna av BALL (libVIEW). De krävs för molekylär "
"visualisering och för att köra BALLView."

#. Summary
#: Package: libballview1.5-dev
msgid "Header files for the VIEW part of the Biochemical Algorithms Library"
msgstr "Huvudfiler för VIEW-delen av Biochemical Algorithms Library"

#. Description
#: Package: libballview1.5-dev
msgid ""
"BALL (Biochemical Algorithms Library) is an application framework in C++ "
"that has been specifically designed for rapid software development in "
"Molecular Modeling and Computational Molecular Biology. This package "
"comprises the header files allowing to create one's own applications with "
"the VIEW framework of the BALL library."
msgstr ""
"BALL (Biochemical Algorithms Library) är ett programramverk i C++ som har "
"utformats särskilt för snabb programvaruutveckling inom molekylmodellering "
"och beräkningsbaserad molekylärbiologi. Paketet omfattar huvudfilerna som "
"gör det möjligt att skapa egna program med VIEW-ramverket i BALL-"
"biblioteket."

#. Summary
