msgstr "__Introduktion__"

#. Description
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-prof Package: libghc-binary-search-doc
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-dev
msgid ""
"This package provides varieties of binary search functions. c.f.  "
"\"Numeric.Search\" for the examples."
msgstr ""
"Paketet tillhandahåller olika binära sökfunktioner. Se \"Numeric.Search\" "
"för exempel."

#. Description
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-prof Package: libghc-binary-search-doc
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-dev
msgid ""
"These search function can search for pure and monadic predicates, of type:"
msgstr ""
"Dessa sökfunktioner kan söka efter rena och monadiska predikat av typen:"

#. Description
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-prof Package: libghc-binary-search-doc
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-dev
msgid "> pred :: Eq b => a -> b > pred :: (Eq b, Monad m) => a -> m b"
msgstr "> pred :: Eq b => a -> b > pred :: (Eq b, Monad m) => a -> m b"

#. Description
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-prof Package: libghc-binary-search-doc
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-dev
msgid ""
"The predicates must satisfy that the domain range for any codomain value is "
"continuous; that is, @∀x≦y≦z. pred x == pred z ⇒ pred y == pred x@ ."
msgstr ""
"Predikaten måste uppfylla att domänintervallet för varje kodomänvärde är "
"kontinuerligt, det vill säga @∀x≦y≦z. pred x == pred z ⇒ pred y == pred x@."

#. Description
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-prof Package: libghc-binary-search-doc
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-dev
msgid ""
"For example, we can address the problem of finding the boundary of an "
"upward-closed set of integers, using a combination of exponential and binary"
" searches."
msgstr ""
"Vi kan till exempel lösa problemet med att hitta gränsen för en uppåtsluten "
"mängd heltal med en kombination av exponentiell och binär sökning."

#. Description
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-prof Package: libghc-binary-search-doc
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-dev
msgid ""
"Variants are provided for searching within bounded and unbounded intervals "
"of both 'Integer' and bounded integral types."
msgstr ""
"Varianter tillhandahålls för sökning inom begränsade och obegränsade "
"intervall av både ”Integer” och begränsade heltalstyper."

#. Description
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-prof Package: libghc-binary-search-doc
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-dev
msgid ""
"The package was created by Ross Paterson, and extended by Takayuki "
"Muranushi, to be used together with SMT solvers."
msgstr ""
"Paketet skapades av Ross Paterson och utökades av Takayuki Muranushi för att"
" användas tillsammans med SMT-lösare."

#. Description
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-prof Package: libghc-binary-search-doc
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-dev
msgid "__The Module Structure__"
msgstr "__Modulstrukturen__"

#. Description
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-prof Package: libghc-binary-search-doc
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-dev
msgid ""
"*  \"Numeric.Search\" provides the generic search combinator, to search for "
"pure and monadic predicates."
msgstr ""
"* \"Numeric.Search\" tillhandahåller den generiska sökkombinatorn för att "
"söka efter rena och monadiska predikat."

#. Description
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-prof Package: libghc-binary-search-doc
#: Package: libghc-binary-search-dev
msgid ""
"*  \"Numeric.Search.Bounded\" ,  \"Numeric.Search.Integer\" , "
"\"Numeric.Search.Range\" provides the various specialized searchers, which "
"means less number of function arguments, and easier to use."
msgstr ""
"* ”Numeric.Search.Bounded”, ”Numeric.Search.Integer” och "
"”Numeric.Search.Range” tillhandahåller de olika specialiserade sökarna, "
"vilket innebär färre funktionsargument och enklare användning."

