msgid "HydraSDR RFOne software defined radio receiver - development"
msgstr "HydraSDR RFOne-mjukvarudefinierad radiomottagare – utveckling"

#. Summary
#: Package: libhydrasdr1 Package: libhydrasdr0
msgid "HydraSDR RFOne software defined radio receiver - library"
msgstr "HydraSDR RFOne-mjukvarudefinierad radiomottagare – bibliotek"

#. Description
#: Package: libhydrasdr1 Package: libhydrasdr0 Package: libhydrasdr-dev
#: Package: hydrasdr-tools
msgid ""
"HydraSDR RFOne is an open source Software Defined Radio that can receive "
"24-1850 MHz. It is a High Speed USB device powered by the USB bus."
msgstr ""
"HydraSDR RFOne är en programvarudefinierad radio med öppen källkod som kan "
"ta emot 24–1850 MHz. Det är en USB-enhet med hög hastighet som drivs av USB-"
"bussen."

