"entities - No DTD whatsoever - No processing instructions - No comments - "
"UTF-8 only - Namespacing-well-formedness enforced - XML 1.0 only - Streamed "
"parsing (parser emits a subset of SAX events) - Streamed encoding - Parser "
"can be driven push- and pull-based - Tokio-based asynchronicity supported "
"via the async feature and [AsyncReader]. Source code for Debianized Rust "
"crate \"rxml\""
msgstr ""
