#. Description
#: Package: libuniversalimporter2 Package: libuniversalimporter-dev Package:
#: libhpctio2 Package: libhpctio-dev Package: libhpctdb2 Package:
#: libhpctdb-dev Package: libhipercontracer2 Package: libhipercontracer-dev
#: Package: hipercontracer-viewer Package: hipercontracer-udp-echo-server
#: Package: hipercontracer-trigger Package: hipercontracer-sync Package:
#: hipercontracer-rtunnel Package: hipercontracer-results Package:
#: hipercontracer-query Package: hipercontracer-node Package:
#: hipercontracer-importer Package: hipercontracer-examples Package:
#: hipercontracer-dbshell Package: hipercontracer-dbeaver-tools Package:
#: hipercontracer-common Package: hipercontracer-collector Package:
#: hipercontracer-all Package: hipercontracer
msgid ""
"High-Performance Connectivity Tracer (HiPerConTracer) is a Ping/Traceroute "
"measurement framework. HiPerConTracer refers to the core measurement tool, "
"which performs regular Ping and Traceroute runs among sites. Key features "
"include: - Multi-transport-protocol support (ICMP, UDP); - Multi-homing and "
"parallelism support; - Handling of network load balancing; - Multi-platform "
"support (currently Linux and FreeBSD); - High-precision (nanosecond) timing "
"(Linux software and hardware timestamping); - Integrated library "
"(shared/static) for third-party software (libhipercontracer); - Open-source "
"C++ codebase focused on performance and portability with only a small number"
" of dependencies."
msgstr ""
"High-Performance Connectivity Tracer (HiPerConTracer) är ett mätramverk för "
"Ping/Traceroute. HiPerConTracer avser kärnmätningsverktyget, som regelbundet"
" kör Ping och Traceroute mellan platser. Viktiga funktioner är: - Stöd för "
"flera transportprotokoll (ICMP, UDP); - stöd för multihoming och "
"parallellism; - hantering av lastbalansering i nätverk; - stöd för flera "
"plattformar (för närvarande Linux och FreeBSD); - högprecisionsmätning "
"(nanosekunder) med program- och hårdvarutidsstämplar i Linux; - integrerat "
"bibliotek (delat/statiskt) för tredjepartsprogramvara (libhipercontracer); -"
" C++-kodbas med öppen källkod, inriktad på prestanda och portabilitet med få"
" beroenden."

#. Description
#: Package: libuniversalimporter2 Package: libuniversalimporter-dev Package:
#: libhpctio2 Package: libhpctio-dev Package: libhpctdb2 Package:
#: libhpctdb-dev Package: libhipercontracer2 Package: libhipercontracer-dev
#: Package: hipercontracer-viewer Package: hipercontracer-udp-echo-server
#: Package: hipercontracer-trigger Package: hipercontracer-sync Package:
#: hipercontracer-rtunnel Package: hipercontracer-results Package:
#: hipercontracer-query Package: hipercontracer-node Package:
#: hipercontracer-importer Package: hipercontracer-examples Package:
#: hipercontracer-dbshell Package: hipercontracer-dbeaver-tools Package:
#: hipercontracer-common Package: hipercontracer-collector Package:
#: hipercontracer-all Package: hipercontracer
msgid ""
"Furthermore, the HiPerConTracer framework provides additional tools for "
"obtaining, processing, collecting, storing, and retrieving measurement data:"
" - Viewer Tool: Displays the contents of results files. - Results Tool: "
"Merges and converts results files (e.g., to CSV format). - Sync Tool: Copies"
" data from a measurement node (vantage point) to a remote collector server "
"via RSync/SSH. - Reverse Tunnel Tool: Maintains a reverse SSH tunnel from a "
"remote measurement node to a collector server. - Collector/Node Tools: "
"Simplify the setup of nodes and collectors. - Trigger Tool: Triggers "
"measurements in the reverse direction. - Importer Tool: Stores measurement "
"data into SQL (MariaDB/MySQL, PostgreSQL) or NoSQL (MongoDB) databases. - "
"Query Tool: Queries data from a database and stores it into a results file. "
"- Database Shell: A simple command-line front-end for the underlying "
"database backends. - Database Tools: Helper scripts to join database "
"configurations into an existing DBeaver configuration. - UDP Echo Server: A "
"UDP Echo (RFC 862) protocol endpoint."
msgstr ""
"Dessutom tillhandahåller HiPerConTracer-ramverket verktyg för att hämta, "
"behandla, samla in, lagra och återvinna mätdata: - Viewer Tool: visar "
"innehållet i resultatfiler. - Results Tool: slår ihop och konverterar "
"resultatfiler (till exempel till CSV-format). - Sync Tool: kopierar data "
"från en mätnod till en fjärransluten insamlingsserver via RSync/SSH. - "
"Reverse Tunnel Tool: upprätthåller en omvänd SSH-tunnel från en "
"fjärransluten mätnod till en insamlingsserver. - Collector/Node Tools: "
"förenklar konfiguration av noder och insamlare. - Trigger Tool: utlöser "
"mätningar i omvänd riktning. - Importer Tool: lagrar mätdata i SQL-databaser"
" (MariaDB/MySQL, PostgreSQL) eller NoSQL-databaser (MongoDB). - Query Tool: "
"frågar efter data från en databas och lagrar dem i en resultatfil. - "
"Database Shell: ett enkelt kommandoradsgränssnitt för underliggande "
"databasdelar. - Database Tools: hjälpskript för att koppla "
"databaskonfigurationer till en befintlig DBeaver-konfiguration. - UDP Echo "
"Server: en slutpunkt för UDP Echo-protokollet (RFC 862)."

