#. Description
#: Package: lilv-utils
msgid ""
"This package provides the following utilities: * lv2info - Extract "
"information about an installed LV2 plugin. * lv2ls - List all installed LV2 "
"plugins. * lv2apply - Apply an LV2 plugin to an audio file. * lv2bench - "
"Benchmark all installed and supported LV2 plugins."
msgstr ""
"Detta paket tillhandahåller följande verktyg: * lv2info – extraherar "
"information om ett installerat LV2-insticksprogram. * lv2ls – listar alla "
"installerade LV2-insticksprogram. * lv2apply – tillämpar ett "
"LV2-insticksprogram på en ljudfil. * lv2bench – prestandamäter alla "
"installerade och stödda LV2-insticksprogram."

#. Summary
