#. Description
#: Package: python-opentelemetry-doc
msgid ""
"OpenTelemetry is a collection of APIs, SDKs, and tools. Use it to "
"instrument, generate, collect, and export telemetry data (metrics, logs, and"
" traces) to help you analyze your software’s performance and behavior."
msgstr ""
"OpenTelemetry är en samling API:er, SDK:er och verktyg. Använd det för att "
"instrumentera, generera, samla in och exportera telemetridata, såsom mått, "
"loggar och spårningar, för att analysera programvarans prestanda och "
"beteende."

#. Description
#: Package: python-opentelemetry-doc
msgid ""
"OpenTelemetry, also known as OTel, is a vendor-neutral open source "
"Observability (https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/observability-"
"primer/#what-is-observability) framework for instrumenting, generating, "
"collecting, and exporting telemetry data such as traces "
"(https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/signals/traces/), metrics "
"(https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/signals/metrics/), and logs "
"(https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/signals/logs/)."
msgstr ""
"OpenTelemetry, även känt som OTel, är ett leverantörsoberoende ramverk med "
"öppen källkod för observerbarhet "
"(https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/observability-primer/#what-is-"
"observability). Det används för att instrumentera, generera, samla in och "
"exportera telemetridata som spårningar "
"(https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/signals/traces/), mått "
"(https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/signals/metrics/) och loggar "
"(https://opentelemetry.io/docs/concepts/signals/logs/)."

